  "precondition": "The agent has identified the clinic (CLIN-01), the provider (PROV-3344), the patient (Maria Lopez, ID: 2), and the visit type (Same-day Sick Visit, ID: 4). It has also retrieved the list of appointment slots for the specified time window.",
  "decision_rule": "Iterate through all appointment slots between 08:00 and 09:00 on 2026-02-03 for the given provider and clinic. For each slot, call 'mcp_server_update_appointment_slot' to set 'capacity_per_slot' to 3 and 'is_overbook_capable' to 1. Once all slots are updated, call 'mcp_server_create_booking' using the last available slot (SL-3004) to schedule the sick visit for Maria Lopez with 'is_same_day_booking' set to 1.",
  "expected_transition": "The appointment slots SL-3002, SL-3003, and SL-3004 will reflect a capacity of 3. A new booking record (e.g., BK-20) will be created in the system for Maria Lopez.",
  "recovery_check": "If an update fails, retry the specific slot update. If the booking creation fails due to capacity, verify the 'remaining_capacity' of the chosen slot and select the next available slot in the 08:00-09:00 window."
